<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   6.693	 6.67-6.71   6.736</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up 200 million, pct allotted at top 14)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   6.619	 6.61-6.63   6.688</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up 300 million, pct allotted at top 12)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
